      {id:'tf-r6',type:'academic_passage',questionLabel:'Question 13 of 18',title:'Urban Gardens',passage:'Community gardens can transform unused urban land into productive green space. In addition to supplying fresh produce, they can create opportunities for neighbors to meet and work together.',prompt:'What is one benefit of community gardens mentioned in the passage?',choices:['They remove all traffic from cities.','They create opportunities for neighbors to work together.','They replace public parks.','They eliminate the need for grocery stores.'],correct:1}
